WEBVTT

00:50.049 --> 00:52.761
ALL CHARACTERS, LOCATIONS,
ORGANIZATIONS, RELIGIONS,

00:52.844 --> 00:55.680
EVENTS, AND OCCUPATIONS
IN THIS DRAMA ARE FICTITIOUS

00:59.392 --> 01:03.271
I hope we can go out safely
and watch this video together.

01:05.398 --> 01:08.359
When that happens, I'll tell you properly…

01:10.028 --> 01:11.154
that I like you.

01:31.800 --> 01:34.594
The call cannot be connected.
Please leave a message after the tone.

01:34.677 --> 01:37.013
Your message
will be charged after the tone.

01:37.764 --> 01:42.769
(I AM) THE LIFESAVER

02:16.553 --> 02:17.428
Seo-yoon.

02:18.179 --> 02:19.430
Sae-bom!

02:25.520 --> 02:28.982
Yi-hyun is still in the apartment.

02:30.358 --> 02:32.527
I'm going to go get him.

02:33.111 --> 02:35.321
How do you feel? Are you feeling better?

02:36.072 --> 02:38.741
I'm here to see my mom.
They said she's here.

02:55.174 --> 02:58.177
Seo-yoon, wait here for a moment.

03:14.319 --> 03:15.862
- Seo-yoon!
- Mom!

03:15.945 --> 03:17.071
Seo-yoon!

03:19.616 --> 03:21.784
Yes, stay there.

03:25.538 --> 03:27.999
I caught a cold.

03:29.542 --> 03:31.628
You're here with the police officer lady.

03:34.213 --> 03:35.298
Are you badly sick?

03:35.381 --> 03:37.217
No, just a little bit.

03:38.176 --> 03:40.887
But I don't want you to catch it too.

03:42.388 --> 03:44.891
I heard you decided to get surgery.

03:44.974 --> 03:45.892
Yes.

03:45.975 --> 03:48.478
You shouldn't get sick
before surgery, okay?

03:49.437 --> 03:50.897
Good luck with your surgery,

03:52.357 --> 03:55.526
and listen to
the police officer lady, okay?

03:56.778 --> 03:59.989
So our family can be healthy
and meet again.

04:03.910 --> 04:07.413
Seo-yoon, you have to listen to your mom.

04:10.875 --> 04:12.377
See you after the surgery.

04:13.503 --> 04:14.545
Mom…

04:16.047 --> 04:17.048
Bye.

04:28.351 --> 04:32.689
I heard that Seo-yoon
can get surgery thanks to you.

04:34.816 --> 04:36.818
You sent us Seo-yoon's letter too, right?

04:38.528 --> 04:40.905
I was able to hold on by reading it.

04:41.572 --> 04:45.451
If I hadn't received it,
I would've ended up like my husband.

04:47.662 --> 04:52.792
I know I'm shameless, but please
look after Seo-yoon a little more.

04:53.793 --> 04:56.296
I don't know what might happen to me, so…

04:57.922 --> 04:59.090
You should go now.

05:00.300 --> 05:01.134
Hurry.

05:46.387 --> 05:48.806
These are typical questions,
so don't be nervous.

05:49.432 --> 05:50.266
Okay.

05:50.933 --> 05:53.603
How many are infected in the apartments?

05:55.229 --> 05:58.066
If Detective Jung Yi-hyun
is infected too, then…

05:59.192 --> 06:00.276
There are two.

06:01.402 --> 06:04.447
There's Mr. Na Soo-min
from the fourth floor.

06:04.530 --> 06:07.909
And there are two who died while infected?

06:09.535 --> 06:12.163
Please tell us everything you know
about the infected.

06:13.664 --> 06:15.666
It might help in developing the cure.

06:17.460 --> 06:18.795
Good luck with your surgery.

06:20.463 --> 06:24.217
I promise I'll come
visit you with Yi-hyun.

06:24.300 --> 06:26.052
My mom got the disease, didn't she?

06:27.178 --> 06:29.555
She's just ill, then.

06:30.139 --> 06:31.182
Like me.

06:34.977 --> 06:35.812
Of course.

06:36.479 --> 06:40.733
So both you and your mom
will get better soon.

06:57.959 --> 06:59.168
Seo-yoon's mother…

06:59.877 --> 07:02.630
She's been enduring it until now
so she can see her daughter,

07:03.214 --> 07:04.841
but she's reached her limit.

07:07.260 --> 07:10.638
She'll be moved to a freezer storage
in one or two days.

07:31.993 --> 07:34.036
These were made with your blood.

07:40.877 --> 07:44.172
The antibodies in your body
are decreasing.

07:46.382 --> 07:47.216
So?

07:47.300 --> 07:49.719
These are the last
effective injections we have now.

07:49.802 --> 07:52.597
These must be amplified
and used for research purposes

07:53.306 --> 07:55.433
in order to develop the cure.

08:02.607 --> 08:03.608
Then you just need…

08:05.193 --> 08:06.903
to yield them to the world.

08:15.203 --> 08:18.206
The Commander of the AFMC
is here to take you.

08:18.998 --> 08:23.377
It means he's going to take
both you and the cure to the lab.

08:26.380 --> 08:27.215
So…

08:28.925 --> 08:30.593
Are you going to break your promise?

09:15.513 --> 09:17.056
What are you doing?

09:17.139 --> 09:18.266
Stop him!

09:21.352 --> 09:22.687
It won't take long.

09:25.731 --> 09:27.650
Do you even know what you're doing?

09:30.444 --> 09:31.487
Of course, I do.

10:02.226 --> 10:03.477
I'm done.

10:12.778 --> 10:15.406
Where's Yoon Sae-bom?
And the remaining cure?

10:16.115 --> 10:18.701
She just left. Didn't you see her?

10:32.757 --> 10:35.968
If you go out the back door on
the first floor, your car will be there.

10:36.052 --> 10:38.387
There are gifts in the car,
so make sure to take them.

10:41.182 --> 10:42.558
But is it okay to do this?

10:43.059 --> 10:46.812
I thought you were a greedy man.

10:47.438 --> 10:50.024
I have plans, so don't worry
and do what you must.

10:51.233 --> 10:54.236
But if you get caught in the act,
I won't take responsibility.

12:04.557 --> 12:05.683
Don't worry.

12:07.059 --> 12:08.144
You will get better.

12:17.403 --> 12:18.571
What did you just do?

12:20.448 --> 12:21.657
That was the cure, right?

12:22.783 --> 12:23.826
Yes.

12:24.618 --> 12:27.413
I tried to just leave, but I couldn't.

12:32.251 --> 12:33.586
Are you going to shoot me?

12:40.342 --> 12:41.719
What are you going to do now?

12:42.678 --> 12:43.971
Even if you get out of here,

12:45.139 --> 12:46.348
you used the cure already.

12:50.394 --> 12:52.188
I'm not that special.

12:52.688 --> 12:56.400
I'm sure you'll find
more people with the antibody.

12:58.235 --> 13:00.779
Yi-hyun has me, but Seo-yoon…

13:02.239 --> 13:03.324
doesn't have anyone.

13:04.950 --> 13:08.496
I just need to be with Yi-hyun until then.

13:56.585 --> 13:57.586
Hurry and get out.

13:57.670 --> 13:59.713
They'll only check
those in quarantine suits.

13:59.797 --> 14:01.465
They won't pay attention to you.

14:04.385 --> 14:07.721
I always knew there was
something between us.

14:12.142 --> 14:13.102
Wait.

14:14.520 --> 14:16.438
You can't just go.

14:19.859 --> 14:21.318
No.

14:22.695 --> 14:25.531
If I look totally fine,
people will suspect me.

14:27.116 --> 14:28.158
Are you sure?

14:29.159 --> 14:30.035
It'll hurt.

14:32.538 --> 14:34.999
Do it, before I change my mind.

14:39.795 --> 14:41.589
Close your eyes and take a deep breath.

14:47.720 --> 14:49.305
Not the face.

14:50.973 --> 14:53.100
Do it where it won't hurt much.

14:53.183 --> 14:55.019
People will suspect you.

14:55.102 --> 14:57.938
And the swelling on the face
goes away more quickly too.

14:59.732 --> 15:00.774
Okay.

15:02.359 --> 15:03.611
In one blow.

15:34.350 --> 15:36.602
ENTRANCE PERMIT

15:36.685 --> 15:38.228
Thanks for the gifts.

16:00.709 --> 16:02.419
Yoon Sae-bom escaped.

16:03.462 --> 16:06.632
You know this won't end
with just your resignation, right?

16:07.257 --> 16:09.885
Are you going to execute me, then?

16:12.179 --> 16:14.139
I thought you were smart.

16:15.891 --> 16:17.017
Why did you do that?

16:18.102 --> 16:21.897
If you only stole one cure for your wife,
that could've been forgiven.

16:26.110 --> 16:28.904
I did all kinds of things
to reduce the number of infected.

16:30.114 --> 16:33.242
Lockdowns, quarantines, destructions…

16:37.287 --> 16:39.039
I got enough blood on my hands.

16:41.083 --> 16:44.086
But thanks to that, you succeeded.
You saved many people too.

16:45.546 --> 16:48.007
I only saw people through the lens
of efficiency and numbers.

16:50.134 --> 16:51.677
But seeing Yoon Sae-bom,

16:53.512 --> 16:55.639
I learned that there are
other ways to see them.

17:41.560 --> 17:42.603
Yi-hyun.

17:54.198 --> 17:57.993
I didn't know how precious you were
when you were by my side.

18:01.080 --> 18:03.082
I'll come and get you, wherever you are.

18:11.215 --> 18:12.216
Salute…

18:14.176 --> 18:16.804
Yoon Sae-bom put your uniform on
and ran away?

18:16.887 --> 18:19.223
Yes. She threw me…

18:19.306 --> 18:20.516
Enough!

18:21.642 --> 18:23.185
Where do you think she went?

18:23.268 --> 18:27.189
It looks like she's trying
to run away overseas with the cure.

18:27.272 --> 18:30.692
It'd be good to put her on a wanted list
mainly around airports and piers.

18:32.111 --> 18:34.738
I'm sure she went to the apartment.
Her husband is there.

18:34.822 --> 18:35.989
Lieutenant Colonel.

18:38.200 --> 18:39.034
Keep going.

18:40.536 --> 18:42.454
Someone in the apartments
has the antibody.

18:49.962 --> 18:54.216
Give me full authority.
Then I'll bring the cure.

18:56.176 --> 18:57.386
Would this really be okay?

18:57.469 --> 19:00.097
Hey, it's okay.
The news said it's fine outside too.

19:00.180 --> 19:03.016
People at Unit 501 all left too,
except for that detective.

19:03.100 --> 19:04.977
But if we go outside too, then…

19:05.060 --> 19:08.355
It's better for us not to be here.
We'd be helping them if we go outside.

19:09.940 --> 19:11.108
What?

19:11.191 --> 19:12.359
Who is that?

19:12.442 --> 19:13.777
Hey, wait.

19:13.861 --> 19:15.112
- Who is that?
- Wait.

19:18.574 --> 19:21.368
Hey, Unit 501! The wife from Unit 501!

19:22.369 --> 19:24.079
Open the door! Hurry!

19:24.163 --> 19:25.205
Hold on.

19:28.709 --> 19:30.502
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

19:30.586 --> 19:33.046
- Did they tell you to go back in?
- Please calm down.

19:33.130 --> 19:35.549
What about Yi-hyun? Is he safe?

19:41.847 --> 19:42.973
Is he alive?

19:49.646 --> 19:51.773
ONE DAY AGO

21:52.978 --> 21:53.854
Yi-hyun.

21:55.063 --> 21:56.106
Get up.

21:58.442 --> 22:00.068
We have to meet again.

22:10.078 --> 22:10.912
Sae-bom.

22:14.291 --> 22:15.751
Mister, are you okay?

22:17.127 --> 22:18.879
You're bleeding badly.

22:21.173 --> 22:22.215
I'm okay.

22:23.383 --> 22:24.551
Let me get some sleep.

22:26.970 --> 22:27.929
Okay.

22:45.739 --> 22:47.199
Are you sure about this?

22:48.450 --> 22:50.994
You said this seems right too.

22:51.078 --> 22:54.081
I told you, it'll be done for
if we get it wrong ten times.

22:55.415 --> 22:57.793
We have to consider
all possible variables.

23:05.175 --> 23:06.593
Damn it.

23:08.303 --> 23:09.763
- So-yoon?
- Who is it?

23:13.308 --> 23:16.520
Help, please. Call the doctor.

23:17.062 --> 23:19.022
My husband got stabbed with a knife.

23:19.106 --> 23:22.150
He is conscious,
but I think he bled too much.

23:24.361 --> 23:29.449
- Mr. Oh isn't here.
- Please. We're sorry about everything.

23:29.533 --> 23:31.743
I said there is no doctor here!

23:32.577 --> 23:34.204
What are you doing?

23:34.287 --> 23:35.705
Yes, there's no one here…

23:35.789 --> 23:37.499
- Doctor!
- Seriously…

23:39.417 --> 23:40.502
Open the door!

23:40.585 --> 23:43.004
But who did that to that man…

23:50.137 --> 23:52.055
- Seriously…
- Open the door, please!

23:52.139 --> 23:53.765
Please! Open the door!

23:53.849 --> 23:54.724
Open the door!

23:54.808 --> 23:59.062
Open the door! Do you think
you'll be safe after we all die?

23:59.146 --> 24:02.190
I'm going to burn this place down!

24:31.011 --> 24:32.637
Doctor.

24:38.059 --> 24:39.311
Are you okay?

24:54.993 --> 24:55.911
Hi.

24:57.245 --> 25:01.958
Hey, did you see that?
He was shot in the arm and leg.

25:02.042 --> 25:03.919
But his bleeding stopped already.

25:04.002 --> 25:06.546
Then it's good. What's the problem?

25:07.797 --> 25:11.009
The smell of his blood is disgusting,

25:11.092 --> 25:12.761
and I don't want to drink it.

25:13.261 --> 25:14.971
It means he's infected.

25:15.055 --> 25:17.682
Then what about my blood?
Did you want to drink my blood?

25:17.766 --> 25:20.685
Hey, listen to me when I say something!
Don't change the topic!

25:20.769 --> 25:22.103
He is infected!

25:22.187 --> 25:24.147
You can't deny it, though.

25:24.231 --> 25:27.776
You even want your sister's blood.
How can you call yourself my brother?

25:28.568 --> 25:29.736
What?

25:30.403 --> 25:32.072
Are you okay?

25:32.697 --> 25:35.408
- What are you doing? Go get water.
- Right.

25:39.913 --> 25:41.623
What brings you two here?

25:43.083 --> 25:47.420
You kept bleeding,
and I couldn't do anything all by myself.

25:49.965 --> 25:52.717
I made him put it on,
just in case the disease might occur.

25:55.136 --> 25:56.137
Here.

26:00.892 --> 26:01.977
Don't you feel thirsty?

26:02.560 --> 26:04.312
It's a lot less these days.

26:04.396 --> 26:09.567
I do feel thirsty,
but diabetes runs in my family.

26:14.572 --> 26:15.949
What about Sae-bom?

26:16.032 --> 26:16.866
What?

26:17.659 --> 26:19.661
She's not in the building.

26:20.620 --> 26:23.164
The other detective
and the kid aren't here, either.

26:23.248 --> 26:24.833
Those people got out, right?

26:25.709 --> 26:28.169
We saw on the news
that the outside is totally fine.

26:28.253 --> 26:31.464
And they said Martial Law has been lifted,
except for quarantine areas.

26:32.674 --> 26:35.510
Maybe the gates are open outside as well.

26:36.136 --> 26:37.637
I don't know much, either.

26:37.721 --> 26:39.097
Don't move.

26:39.180 --> 26:41.016
You have two holes in your body.

26:44.978 --> 26:46.563
I bit Andrew.

26:47.522 --> 26:48.606
What?

26:49.941 --> 26:53.069
He's a murderer so if he's infected,
he'll become even more dangerous.

26:53.862 --> 26:55.196
If he's alive,

26:57.699 --> 26:58.742
then we must catch him.

27:50.960 --> 27:54.214
Let's look for him on our way downstairs
before he kills more people.

27:54.297 --> 27:55.507
Okay.

27:56.091 --> 27:58.676
While the CDSCHQ
is minimizing the infections

27:58.760 --> 28:00.970
with quick diagnoses
and bold local quarantines,

28:01.054 --> 28:04.307
it looks like the prevention of
Mad Human Disease will be possible soon.

28:04.391 --> 28:07.060
According to the authorities, the vaccine

28:07.143 --> 28:09.729
currently being clinically tested
seems effective,

28:09.813 --> 28:12.565
and they said they will request
the public health authorities

28:12.649 --> 28:16.152
to give it emergency use authorization
as soon as it shows optimistic results.

28:17.404 --> 28:19.280
Drink this.

28:19.364 --> 28:21.491
You should eat something to get energy.

28:21.574 --> 28:25.328
They decided to maintain quarantine
until the cure is developed.

28:25.412 --> 28:27.288
Therefore, the current lockdown

28:27.372 --> 28:31.418
on nursing homes, apartments
and so on will continue,

28:31.501 --> 28:33.044
and additional local--

28:46.182 --> 28:49.352
Look who's here. It's the brave detective.

28:49.936 --> 28:52.439
By the way, did you get hurt
in the electrical room?

28:53.940 --> 28:55.191
Is someone injured?

28:57.235 --> 28:59.362
The moving-in cleaner couple
on the second floor.

28:59.446 --> 29:03.199
The husband got stabbed by Andrew,
so I'm treating him right now.

29:03.283 --> 29:05.660
I see neither Andrew
nor the building representative.

29:05.744 --> 29:08.246
- Do you know where they are?
- I guess they went outside.

29:12.459 --> 29:13.501
Where's your wife?

29:14.919 --> 29:16.546
Andrew is dangerous right now.

29:17.213 --> 29:18.673
Never open the door for him.

29:19.591 --> 29:23.261
I'm going to make all three of you
get punished by the law, if possible.

29:24.262 --> 29:26.473
You mean our neighbor? Unit 602?

29:26.556 --> 29:29.142
Sang-hee had an affair
with the lawyer of that house, and…

29:29.225 --> 29:31.644
Look at this. They did this to me.

29:32.479 --> 29:35.106
Shouldn't you arrest them first?

29:35.190 --> 29:37.776
We're coming from Unit 602, okay?

29:37.859 --> 29:41.237
The lawyer showed us
the bite mark on his arm.

29:42.947 --> 29:45.533
Right, I got the disease.

29:45.617 --> 29:48.036
But there are a lot of people
who got the disease.

29:48.119 --> 29:51.956
Biting someone
wouldn't be punishable, would it?

29:53.458 --> 29:54.584
Mr. Oh.

29:57.045 --> 29:58.713
You didn't get the disease.

30:01.132 --> 30:02.675
I know because I got the disease.

30:04.552 --> 30:07.806
I am holding in my desire
to bite you right now.

30:09.015 --> 30:11.810
I took the drug too!

30:11.893 --> 30:14.437
Taking that drug
doesn't always give you the disease.

30:15.647 --> 30:17.065
Some get it late…

30:18.650 --> 30:20.068
or never get it at all.

30:24.781 --> 30:26.032
Where's Mr. Ko?

30:26.115 --> 30:27.283
Here.

30:33.081 --> 30:36.543
Doctor, his condition is worsening.
Can't you do anything?

30:36.626 --> 30:41.047
Of course his condition is bad,
with that thing in his body.

30:41.130 --> 30:45.051
Honey, I'm okay. I will recover soon.

30:46.845 --> 30:49.264
So, tell that jerk
to get out of here, please.

30:49.347 --> 30:50.473
Tell him to get out.

30:50.557 --> 30:52.851
Hey, this is my house!

31:09.659 --> 31:11.411
How long can Mr. Ko last?

31:12.745 --> 31:14.831
If we pull out the knife,
he'll die right away.

31:15.582 --> 31:17.750
If we leave him be,
he'll last maybe two days.

31:19.669 --> 31:22.839
Let's find a way to send them outside.
Treat his wound until then.

31:22.922 --> 31:24.674
I gave him painkillers and my bedroom!

31:24.757 --> 31:26.593
What more can I do?

31:33.641 --> 31:37.520
You kept Mr. Ko and Ms. Ji here
for when you feel thirsty, right?

31:38.980 --> 31:41.190
What do you take me for?
How dare you say that?

31:41.816 --> 31:44.861
Did you take that? And that's why
you thought you were infected?

31:52.994 --> 31:55.997
Yes, I was keeping them
as my boxed lunches! So what?

31:56.080 --> 31:58.583
I took it because
I felt like I could die too!

32:00.084 --> 32:01.586
Just treat him well.

32:02.503 --> 32:04.756
If you cause any more trouble

32:04.839 --> 32:07.216
then I'll lock you up in the basement.

32:07.842 --> 32:09.886
Do you think you can lock me up?

32:09.969 --> 32:13.222
Do you think
you're King Solomon or something?

32:33.826 --> 32:34.827
Honey.

32:35.703 --> 32:38.539
Take this.

32:40.500 --> 32:43.378
If you take this drug,
then your wound will heal quickly.

32:51.010 --> 32:52.470
Did you swallow it?

32:58.434 --> 33:00.269
You love me, right?

33:01.562 --> 33:03.940
You won't bite me
even if you get the disease, right?

33:15.535 --> 33:16.703
Hey.

33:16.786 --> 33:18.371
Sir, are you okay?

33:20.623 --> 33:22.625
I'm not okay.

33:24.043 --> 33:27.255
You don't look okay either, young man.

33:28.548 --> 33:29.841
How's your wife?

33:29.924 --> 33:32.218
We're okay, so…

33:32.760 --> 33:36.931
Just look after our son, please.

33:38.808 --> 33:40.601
He's still not back?

33:41.436 --> 33:46.274
What? Isn't he on the second floor?

33:48.818 --> 33:50.611
He said he wanted to go outside, but…

33:56.200 --> 33:58.286
If you see him,

33:58.369 --> 34:01.622
tell him to come back home. We're fine.

34:02.749 --> 34:07.128
Home is a place where you can go back to
when you're having a hard time.

34:08.588 --> 34:09.839
Okay.

34:10.339 --> 34:11.632
If you see Andrew…

34:14.844 --> 34:17.597
If you see an unfamiliar man,
don't open the door for him.

34:18.222 --> 34:19.348
He's very dangerous.

34:21.517 --> 34:22.602
Okay.

34:23.895 --> 34:27.899
Why would he come here, though?
It's just two old people here.

34:27.982 --> 34:30.943
Sir, do you have enough food?

34:31.027 --> 34:32.737
Would you like us to give you some?

34:37.033 --> 34:39.744
Don't give them food.
We barely have enough for us.

34:41.120 --> 34:43.164
I'm going to share mine.

34:43.247 --> 34:44.999
How can you be so mean?

35:05.520 --> 35:06.771
You two, stand back.

35:07.814 --> 35:09.398
He's infected.

35:11.067 --> 35:13.444
I saw him biting Andrew.

35:14.153 --> 35:15.571
But I'm infected too.

35:16.239 --> 35:18.491
Building representative,
this is no time to fight.

35:19.075 --> 35:22.245
There's a high chance
of Andrew still being in the building.

35:25.790 --> 35:27.708
Andrew is dead.

36:00.032 --> 36:02.535
I was going to go outside
and meet the person in charge.

36:02.618 --> 36:04.662
But the infected are at the entrance too.

36:05.413 --> 36:09.417
Still, we caught the killer,
so we just need to wait quietly.

36:09.500 --> 36:13.254
So, did you get rid of Andrew's dead body?

36:15.423 --> 36:16.632
It's on the rooftop.

36:18.217 --> 36:20.344
You bit him to death, Mr. Jung!

36:21.929 --> 36:23.347
There's no one on the rooftop.

36:26.851 --> 36:28.686
It looks like you're trying to trick me.

36:29.812 --> 36:31.230
Do you think I'm stupid?

36:31.731 --> 36:32.607
I'm not!

36:34.692 --> 36:38.279
I'm normal.
I'm not like you infected people!

36:42.074 --> 36:44.410
It's dangerous to go alone,
building representative.

36:49.415 --> 36:53.336
Is it okay to just let her be like that?

36:54.879 --> 36:56.547
She lost her family.

36:59.550 --> 37:01.594
I'm sure she needs someone
to blame and hate.

37:04.347 --> 37:05.514
Oh, gosh.

37:42.385 --> 37:45.888
I'm sure he hid Andrew's body
and lied to me.

37:45.972 --> 37:48.683
I can kill him too if something happens.

37:54.230 --> 37:57.024
It looks like Andrew
and Kim Dong-hyun both went outside.

38:04.949 --> 38:06.033
What?

38:09.870 --> 38:10.746
Hey.

38:22.675 --> 38:26.095
What are you doing?
What if the infected crowd in?

38:26.178 --> 38:27.346
Don't come out.

38:27.430 --> 38:28.389
Okay.

38:34.687 --> 38:35.521
But…

38:58.419 --> 38:59.503
Are you okay?

39:06.802 --> 39:08.721
How long has it been since you got bitten?

39:15.478 --> 39:18.689
Hey, isn't that
the jobless guy on the third floor?

39:20.149 --> 39:21.609
It looks like he's hurt.

39:21.692 --> 39:23.527
Hurt? He got bitten!

39:34.622 --> 39:36.415
Didn't he…

39:38.376 --> 39:41.170
get the disease?

39:42.380 --> 39:43.631
It hasn't occurred yet.

39:45.591 --> 39:48.677
I'm sure he can endure a bit more
if he's with his family.

40:16.664 --> 40:18.082
Dad, I'm sorry.

40:22.628 --> 40:24.839
My goodness.

40:30.678 --> 40:31.971
Honey.

40:33.389 --> 40:36.684
Dong-hyun is home.

40:57.329 --> 40:58.622
Moon-hee.

40:59.999 --> 41:01.250
What?

41:03.377 --> 41:06.213
Are you okay? Are you coming to?

41:06.797 --> 41:07.840
It hurts less.

41:08.716 --> 41:10.759
Who gave you that drug from earlier?

41:13.721 --> 41:17.224
How about we pull this out, Moon-hee?

41:21.896 --> 41:22.730
Okay.

41:24.315 --> 41:25.399
Wait.

41:28.652 --> 41:30.154
Do you have more of that drug?

41:36.577 --> 41:37.745
Give me water.

41:45.544 --> 41:46.795
Let's pull it out.

41:48.881 --> 41:50.049
I'm going to pull it out.

41:51.008 --> 41:52.468
Moon-hee, you know…

41:54.053 --> 41:56.347
I can't just leave this place
when I'm such a mess.

41:59.433 --> 42:00.684
Let's take this house.

42:04.813 --> 42:05.814
How?

42:21.413 --> 42:22.665
Doctor.

42:23.457 --> 42:25.626
Why? Did your husband die?

42:28.170 --> 42:29.547
I pulled the knife out.

42:30.381 --> 42:31.423
Seriously?

42:31.507 --> 42:34.635
I told you not to pull it out!
Did he bleed a lot on the floor?

42:34.718 --> 42:36.720
Why didn't you listen to me!

42:40.891 --> 42:41.725
Doctor…

42:43.644 --> 42:45.229
you don't have any family, do you?

42:57.241 --> 42:59.910
Doesn't this look a lot
more swollen than before?

43:00.494 --> 43:03.831
How many times
do I have to tell you it doesn't!

43:05.749 --> 43:06.917
Are you sure?

43:08.335 --> 43:09.628
I am.

43:09.712 --> 43:12.298
Stop touching it!
That's what's making it more swollen!

43:15.509 --> 43:17.720
Are you sure this is okay?

43:19.722 --> 43:21.640
What should we do with the cryptocurrency?

43:21.724 --> 43:24.018
We have the passcode,
but we don't have the laptop.

43:27.271 --> 43:28.480
The laptop!

43:32.860 --> 43:36.280
Sang-hee! I'll give you money,
so open the door.

43:36.363 --> 43:38.240
Open the door, Sang-hee!

43:38.324 --> 43:40.659
Isn't he trying to bite us again?

43:41.452 --> 43:42.870
I'll give you money.

43:47.333 --> 43:48.792
- How much will you give me?
- Hey!

43:48.876 --> 43:50.961
That cleaner asshole has gone totally mad!

43:51.045 --> 43:52.212
He's insane!

43:53.756 --> 43:54.882
Stop!

44:03.015 --> 44:06.018
If Mr. Ko is in a critical condition
then we must send him out.

44:06.101 --> 44:09.063
- We can't just let him die like that.
- Detective Jung!

44:14.943 --> 44:17.237
Detective Jung, help me.
I almost got killed.

44:19.615 --> 44:20.699
What now?

44:22.159 --> 44:25.579
He gave us the drug.
He said my husband would get better.

44:25.663 --> 44:27.373
Are you nuts, old woman?

44:27.456 --> 44:30.793
It's not true!
Why would I make more monsters?

44:32.961 --> 44:34.254
Is Mr. Ko okay?

44:34.338 --> 44:37.132
He's still in pain.
He's lying down right now.

44:38.217 --> 44:41.220
Can you please chase him away?

44:41.303 --> 44:44.098
I'm terrified to be with him.

44:44.181 --> 44:47.184
They're the ones who should be kicked out!

44:47.267 --> 44:50.938
Don't you trust me?
We're residents of the same apartment.

44:52.022 --> 44:53.774
This is the first time hearing you say

44:53.857 --> 44:55.901
we're residents of the same apartment.

44:56.777 --> 44:57.945
I warned you, didn't I?

44:58.654 --> 45:01.073
- You're going to the gym.
- The laptop!

45:01.156 --> 45:02.991
Tell them to give me my laptop!

45:03.492 --> 45:05.911
My laptop!

45:09.331 --> 45:10.791
- Get the elevator.
- Right.

45:17.005 --> 45:18.465
Are you happy that I'm leaving?

45:20.801 --> 45:21.844
What the…

45:32.062 --> 45:33.480
What are you doing?

45:34.189 --> 45:35.774
Where are you taking Dr. Oh?

45:36.275 --> 45:38.152
He's going to be in quarantine.

45:38.777 --> 45:41.780
If you don't want to end up like him,
you should be careful.

45:56.920 --> 46:00.632
Honey. This is all ours, right?

46:00.716 --> 46:01.967
Of course.

46:02.509 --> 46:04.303
That jerk doesn't have any family.

46:04.386 --> 46:07.097
I almost got killed by that asshole.

46:08.182 --> 46:11.185
We just need to demand this house
for compensation.

46:12.436 --> 46:14.396
But he'll never give it up.

46:15.063 --> 46:17.274
We'll get rid of him
before the lockdown is over.

46:18.025 --> 46:19.818
They'll think that the infected did it.

46:20.652 --> 46:21.528
Right?

46:24.239 --> 46:26.575
Moon-hee…

46:28.327 --> 46:29.369
Give me some water.

46:29.995 --> 46:30.871
Okay.

46:45.677 --> 46:47.179
Just take this too.

46:51.099 --> 46:52.893
I'm really thirsty for some reason.

47:06.573 --> 47:07.908
How much is all of this?

47:08.784 --> 47:15.207
One, two, three…

47:28.971 --> 47:32.432
Why didn't you go outside with your wife?

47:37.980 --> 47:40.274
I had to watch the house
until Sae-bom got back.

47:41.483 --> 47:44.236
We got this as
a special provision for public officials,

47:44.319 --> 47:45.779
and it was hard to get it.

47:51.702 --> 47:54.871
We know what you did for us.

47:56.164 --> 48:01.044
If it wasn't for you,
something terrible would've happened.

48:03.046 --> 48:04.172
Thank you.

48:10.012 --> 48:13.265
I should look for Andrew once more
after getting some rest.

48:14.266 --> 48:16.893
It can be dangerous,
so you two should go home now.

48:17.477 --> 48:19.479
We can help too.

48:20.397 --> 48:22.232
I can be dangerous too.

48:24.318 --> 48:26.445
Mr. Na seems much better now…

48:28.780 --> 48:29.990
but I'm not.

48:37.456 --> 48:38.790
Be careful.

49:35.180 --> 49:36.139
Sae-bom.

49:40.686 --> 49:41.895
How are you doing?

49:55.867 --> 49:56.743
I miss you.

50:24.479 --> 50:26.773
We were saved thanks to Mr. Jung.

50:27.482 --> 50:29.317
He's infected, but…

50:30.318 --> 50:31.403
So he's home now?

50:32.946 --> 50:35.115
It's dangerous.
Don't go outside. Stay home.

50:35.699 --> 50:38.410
- The lockdown will be over soon.
- What? Really?

50:38.493 --> 50:40.620
See? I told you not to go outside!

50:40.704 --> 50:41.538
Great.

50:42.247 --> 50:43.373
That's awesome.

51:00.015 --> 51:04.436
Hey! Sang-hee. I knew you'd come.

51:05.312 --> 51:09.149
Let me go! Let me go and talk!

51:10.442 --> 51:12.402
What are you trying to do without the key?

51:13.612 --> 51:15.614
Building representative, please help me!

51:16.281 --> 51:17.949
I only came here to help…

51:18.575 --> 51:20.160
Are you mad, old woman?

51:25.457 --> 51:28.960
Isn't it better to get rid
of that detective jerk on our own?

51:29.044 --> 51:32.339
The woman ran away,
so we just need to get rid of him.

51:34.549 --> 51:38.345
So are you saying
we should kill the detective?

51:38.929 --> 51:40.305
He's infected.

51:43.350 --> 51:47.229
This can break that thing, so do as I say.

52:03.745 --> 52:05.205
Help!

52:19.344 --> 52:20.262
Mr. Oh…

52:21.388 --> 52:22.681
Calm down

52:23.849 --> 52:25.308
and let Ms. Woo go.

52:25.392 --> 52:29.396
Mr. Jung, just kill everyone uninfected

52:30.897 --> 52:33.984
and say it was all because of the disease.

52:34.067 --> 52:34.901
Yes.

52:35.569 --> 52:38.738
The monsters did all of this.

52:39.489 --> 52:41.992
You people are the monsters,
not those with the disease.

52:43.785 --> 52:46.288
Aren't you thirsty?

52:59.217 --> 53:01.177
Let's see who the real monster is.

53:06.099 --> 53:07.100
Go.

53:21.114 --> 53:23.700
Jung Yi-hyun!

53:24.451 --> 53:26.119
Doesn't the blood smell good?

53:26.202 --> 53:29.122
Don't hold it in! You must've been
holding it in all this time!

53:29.205 --> 53:31.625
Jung Yi-hyun!

53:32.417 --> 53:34.294
Come out!

53:34.377 --> 53:36.171
Hey, come out!

53:42.886 --> 53:44.304
Why aren't you listening to me?

53:45.221 --> 53:47.599
These apartments are mine! Listen to me!

53:53.897 --> 53:54.898
Calm down.

53:54.981 --> 53:56.691
I'm not here to catch you.

54:01.738 --> 54:03.531
You killed my husband.

54:04.324 --> 54:06.910
I caught the murderer,
and I'm not infected either.

54:06.993 --> 54:08.495
I deserve to be the representative.

54:08.578 --> 54:09.871
Okay.

54:10.580 --> 54:12.582
I'll vote for you
when you get released from prison.

54:14.417 --> 54:16.544
- Thank you.
- Come out!

54:16.628 --> 54:18.588
- Thank you.
- Hey, come out!

54:19.089 --> 54:20.382
Come out!

54:20.465 --> 54:22.676
Just come out! Bite me! Change!

54:22.759 --> 54:24.552
My disease will occur soon too!

54:26.554 --> 54:27.889
You're so dead!

54:50.745 --> 54:52.038
Yi-hyun.

54:58.795 --> 55:00.046
I'm here.

55:17.230 --> 55:19.149
I realized it after I heard what you said.

55:20.734 --> 55:22.152
What's really important is…

55:24.112 --> 55:26.197
who I'm going to be with in my house.

55:30.243 --> 55:33.246
So I'm going to stay with you.

55:38.084 --> 55:39.711
Stay with me.

56:20.085 --> 56:23.838
I'm fine with whatever state you're in.

57:37.412 --> 57:40.790
Are you sure that someone
in the apartment has the antibody?

57:41.416 --> 57:42.667
Someone testified.

57:42.750 --> 57:46.254
Please tell us everything you know
about the infected.

57:46.838 --> 57:48.882
It might help in developing the cure.

57:49.591 --> 57:51.634
I don't know much, but…

57:52.135 --> 57:54.137
Ms. Na said

57:54.846 --> 57:57.348
her brother's wound didn't change.

57:57.432 --> 58:00.059
She said it neither gets worse nor heals.

58:00.143 --> 58:02.645
You relied on that
and asked for full authority?

58:03.146 --> 58:04.439
Ji-soo.

58:06.774 --> 58:08.943
We never had anything
to rely on from the start.

58:30.006 --> 58:32.342
Hae-seong, please open the door.

58:32.425 --> 58:33.718
I got the cryptocurrency!

58:35.303 --> 58:36.971
It's been hard for you, right?

58:37.055 --> 58:39.057
Sorry for being so sensitive.

58:39.140 --> 58:40.600
SO-YOON, ARE YOU SAFE?
I MISS YOU SO MUCH

58:40.683 --> 58:43.603
Come on, we did this
so we can all be happy.

58:46.064 --> 58:48.900
Hae-seong, are you listening? Hae-seong!

58:48.983 --> 58:50.860
SHIN SO-YOON

58:51.611 --> 58:53.363
Hae-seong!

58:53.446 --> 58:56.032
Darling, we can be happy now!

58:56.115 --> 58:57.951
- Open the door.
- So-yoon?

58:59.452 --> 59:02.205
I'm really sorry. It's all my fault, okay?

59:02.288 --> 59:04.707
- Hae-seong!
- Don't ever contact me again.

59:04.791 --> 59:07.752
- No, I…
- Hae-seong, you're in there, right?

59:07.835 --> 59:11.297
I really regret what I did. I mean it.

59:11.381 --> 59:13.174
- Okay?
- Can you hear me?

59:13.258 --> 59:17.428
- Come here and open the door!
- But I really am repenting…

59:17.512 --> 59:19.305
We can be happy!

59:19.389 --> 59:20.515
Hae-seong!

59:21.474 --> 59:23.726
- The call cannot be connected…
- Darling!

59:30.608 --> 59:33.027
Hae-seong, what we had was good.

59:33.111 --> 59:35.905
It'll be even better now, okay?

59:37.282 --> 59:40.618
Open the door, will you?

59:42.745 --> 59:44.789
Right, I can have her instead.

59:47.750 --> 59:48.751
Damn it.

59:48.835 --> 59:50.211
Were you bitten on your arm?

59:55.842 --> 59:57.260
Is the Internet working now?

59:58.469 --> 01:00:00.763
Hae-seong! I'll share this with you.

01:00:02.265 --> 01:00:04.642
- The passcode.
- Okay.

01:00:13.026 --> 01:00:15.528
LOG IN

01:00:19.198 --> 01:00:20.366
WELCOME TO OPBIT

01:00:28.249 --> 01:00:29.250
Over here.

01:00:35.340 --> 01:00:40.345
TOTAL ASSET
TOTAL PROFIT

01:00:40.428 --> 01:00:44.140
The future still looks gloomy
for various economic indexes.

01:00:44.223 --> 01:00:46.017
The stock markets all around the world

01:00:46.100 --> 01:00:47.769
are dropping every day.

01:00:47.852 --> 01:00:51.773
The number of stocks at its lowest price
exceeded 30 today.

01:00:51.856 --> 01:00:53.775
The prices of oil, gold,

01:00:53.858 --> 01:00:55.526
- Honey…
- and raw materials plummeted.

01:00:55.610 --> 01:00:57.320
The national oil price is now…

01:00:57.403 --> 01:01:00.740
The cure will be out someday, right?

01:01:00.823 --> 01:01:03.660
It'll be out in no time.

01:01:04.535 --> 01:01:06.913
Suddenly, the people
from the Community Health Center

01:01:06.996 --> 01:01:09.374
could come to our house
and ring our doorbell.

01:01:09.916 --> 01:01:15.588
The cryptocurrency market value today…

01:01:18.049 --> 01:01:19.133
What…

01:01:19.926 --> 01:01:21.678
What?

01:01:24.806 --> 01:01:27.350
Mom, they're here! We're saved!

01:01:28.518 --> 01:01:33.523
I told you they'd come, didn't I?

01:01:33.606 --> 01:01:34.816
Careful.

01:01:34.899 --> 01:01:36.150
We're saved!

01:01:36.984 --> 01:01:38.277
Honey!

01:01:40.947 --> 01:01:42.281
Thank you.

01:01:50.248 --> 01:01:53.418
No, I didn't bite anybody.
I'm telling the truth.

01:01:53.501 --> 01:01:55.920
I don't feel thirsty, either.

01:01:56.003 --> 01:01:59.048
Give me water, then. I mean it.
I really don't feel thirsty.

01:01:59.132 --> 01:02:01.259
I swear I didn't bite anybody.

01:02:01.342 --> 01:02:02.760
He really was totally fine.

01:02:03.261 --> 01:02:05.596
Maybe he's all better.
No, I'm sure he's all better.

01:02:05.680 --> 01:02:06.681
Right, Soo-min?

01:02:06.764 --> 01:02:08.975
I am. Because I'm not thirsty.

01:02:18.151 --> 01:02:19.736
Nothing's wrong, right?

01:02:21.612 --> 01:02:23.573
- I don't feel thirsty.
- Don't talk too much!

01:02:23.656 --> 01:02:24.991
I'm telling the truth.

01:02:30.163 --> 01:02:32.749
We found the holder of the antibody.
We're taking him now.

01:02:34.917 --> 01:02:38.546
And I will take care of Yoon Sae-bom.

01:02:39.130 --> 01:02:41.758
It's up to you.
Just bring the holder of the antibody.

01:02:44.677 --> 01:02:45.803
Take him safely.

01:02:47.138 --> 01:02:48.723
Find Yoon Sae-bom and Jung Yi-hyun

01:02:50.224 --> 01:02:51.934
and take them to the dorm.

01:02:52.769 --> 01:02:54.061
Yes, sir.

01:02:54.145 --> 01:02:56.481
No!

01:02:56.564 --> 01:02:57.398
This is our house!

01:02:57.482 --> 01:02:58.816
What are you doing? No!

01:02:58.900 --> 01:03:00.026
I said, stop!

01:03:00.109 --> 01:03:02.904
Honey, what are they doing?

01:03:02.987 --> 01:03:04.864
- No! This is our house!
- No!

01:03:04.947 --> 01:03:06.282
No!

01:03:12.246 --> 01:03:13.748
- This is our house!
- This is mine!

01:03:13.831 --> 01:03:15.625
- No! I'm taking these!
- No! Let go!

01:03:15.708 --> 01:03:17.502
- No! These are mine!
- This is our house!

01:03:17.585 --> 01:03:19.128
- Let go!
- This is mine!

01:03:19.212 --> 01:03:20.630
- No! This is our house!
- No!

01:03:20.713 --> 01:03:22.131
I can't leave them here!

01:03:22.215 --> 01:03:24.091
- I won't go!
- Let go!

01:03:24.175 --> 01:03:25.968
- I'm taking them!
- This is our house!

01:03:26.052 --> 01:03:28.304
- Those are mine!
- Honey! This is our house!

01:03:31.516 --> 01:03:32.683
Stay here.

01:03:33.309 --> 01:03:34.977
It's hot but you can't help it.

01:03:35.061 --> 01:03:38.981
Don't you dare think that this is the end.

01:03:39.690 --> 01:03:42.735
Sae-bom, you will vote for me, right?

01:03:44.445 --> 01:03:45.530
I will.

01:03:45.613 --> 01:03:46.656
Let's go.

01:04:02.922 --> 01:04:04.090
We shouldn't leave…

01:04:05.633 --> 01:04:07.218
Kim Se-hoon like that, right?

01:04:09.095 --> 01:04:10.429
Let's put him in his house.

01:04:11.472 --> 01:04:12.723
I'll open the door.

01:04:44.213 --> 01:04:45.882
Call Yoon Sae-bom.

01:05:12.116 --> 01:05:13.618
Drop your gun, Ms. Yoon.

01:05:14.118 --> 01:05:15.578
Just shoot him.

01:05:15.661 --> 01:05:16.913
It's okay if I get shot.

01:05:20.791 --> 01:05:22.919
Drop your gun if you want
to save Jung Yi-hyun!

01:05:23.002 --> 01:05:24.795
I'm fine, so just shoot!

01:05:55.284 --> 01:05:56.786
Here, fresh blood.

01:06:41.622 --> 01:06:42.999
Yi-hyun!

01:06:45.042 --> 01:06:45.918
Yi-hyun!

01:06:53.759 --> 01:06:57.680
I told you I'll be the bad cop.

01:06:59.015 --> 01:06:59.974
So you…

01:07:01.600 --> 01:07:03.477
keep being the good cop.

01:07:07.314 --> 01:07:08.149
Hey.

01:07:16.073 --> 01:07:17.491
Hey!

01:07:20.036 --> 01:07:21.203
Yi-hyun!

01:07:21.287 --> 01:07:22.329
No!

01:07:23.622 --> 01:07:24.749
Yi-hyun!

01:07:25.750 --> 01:07:27.168
Jung Yi-hyun!

01:07:46.937 --> 01:07:52.860
CENTRAL DISTRICT COURT

01:08:15.007 --> 01:08:17.802
DEFENDANT

01:08:42.993 --> 01:08:44.120
Mr. Lee Seung-young.

01:09:21.699 --> 01:09:23.367
Careful.

01:09:23.450 --> 01:09:25.953
Are you okay after all that running?

01:09:26.036 --> 01:09:27.496
I'm totally fine.

01:09:27.580 --> 01:09:28.622
Really?

01:09:28.706 --> 01:09:31.208
Should we start some real workouts, then?

01:09:31.292 --> 01:09:32.459
How about the gym?

01:09:32.543 --> 01:09:34.128
All residents can work out there.

01:09:39.091 --> 01:09:42.052
I have plans, so I have to go home now.

01:09:42.136 --> 01:09:43.095
What?

01:09:43.179 --> 01:09:44.138
Goodbye.

01:09:44.221 --> 01:09:45.556
What plans?

01:09:46.307 --> 01:09:47.141
Seo-yoon.

01:09:48.142 --> 01:09:50.186
Now then, let's go.

01:09:59.028 --> 01:10:00.446
What are you thinking about?

01:10:01.155 --> 01:10:04.116
Last year, when we got locked up in here.

01:10:05.743 --> 01:10:07.411
It was tough, wasn't it?

01:10:08.037 --> 01:10:08.954
Still…

01:10:10.623 --> 01:10:12.374
it was all right because I had you.

01:10:17.504 --> 01:10:19.256
Since when did you start liking me?

01:10:20.758 --> 01:10:22.760
From the very start, I told you.

01:10:22.843 --> 01:10:24.386
Why won't you believe me?

01:10:24.470 --> 01:10:26.305
I knew you were my destiny,

01:10:26.388 --> 01:10:28.224
and we'd be together until the end.

01:10:28.307 --> 01:10:31.227
So you never gave up?

01:10:31.810 --> 01:10:33.437
Why do you think I became a cop?

01:10:33.520 --> 01:10:36.315
Hey, did you become a cop because of me?

01:10:37.316 --> 01:10:40.778
I thought about going to the US,
but what you said kept coming to mind.

01:10:41.445 --> 01:10:44.365
You said there's no limit to our futures,
so I should just do it.

01:10:44.448 --> 01:10:47.868
- But then you joined the SOU.
- Hey! I didn't know.

01:10:51.247 --> 01:10:53.707
So are you happy?

01:10:57.002 --> 01:10:58.170
Of course, I am.

01:10:58.837 --> 01:11:00.214
When I'm with you.

01:11:02.841 --> 01:11:05.135
- I'm not that happy without you.
- You liar.

01:11:07.263 --> 01:11:10.099
The winner is exempt
from taking out the trash for one week!

01:11:10.182 --> 01:11:11.934
You cheated! Hey!

01:11:12.017 --> 01:11:13.769
And food waste too!

01:11:13.852 --> 01:11:15.479
I won't lose!

01:12:31.722 --> 01:12:34.933
THANK YOU FOR WATCHING HAPPINESS

01:12:36.810 --> 01:12:41.815
Subtitle translation by: Hae-lim Lee
